Hello Barclaycard team,

I am the developer at Vesopa Software Ltd, which makes the Vesopa EPOS, back =
office and online ordering used by hospitality venues and clubs in the UK. A =
client asked us to offer Barclaycard, so we have built Smartpay Fuse into Ves=
opa on our sandbox account (Organization ID vesopa_uk_1792070796), and we wou=
ld now like to take it live.

WHAT IS BUILT
- Online menu: Barclaycard's Unified Checkout: Guests order at their table an=
d pay on Barclaycard's secure card form, which opens straight away. Paid orde=
rs reach the till and kitchen already paid. Live demo on our sandbox: https:/=
/menu.vesopa.com/vesopakitchen.
- EPOS till: pay on the customer's phone: Card on the till shows a QR code (o=
n the till and the customer display). The customer pays by card, Apple Pay or=
 Google Pay on Barclaycard's form, and the sale closes on the till by itself.=
 Cancel, status check and refunds to the card from the till.
- Back office: per venue, sandbox and live: Each venue saves its own Smartpay=
 Fuse keys (checked with Barclaycard before saving, shared secret stored encr=
ypted) and chooses Dojo, Teya or Barclaycard for its tills and its online men=
u in one tap.
- Tested on the sandbox: Payments, refunds, voids and capture contexts (HTTP =
Signature, REST) against api.smartpayfuse-test.barclaycard, on our test venue=
 The Vesopa Kitchen.

Live demo (sandbox): https://menu.vesopa.com/vesopakitchen
Choose a table, order, Pay by card, test card 4111 1111 1111 1111 (any future=
 expiry, CVV 123). Test orders never reach a till or the takings.

WHAT WE WOULD LIKE TO AGREE
1. Live (production) REST API keys for Smartpay Fuse, with the merchant (Orga=
nization) account for Vesopa Software Ltd
2. Unified Checkout on live, with Apple Pay, Google Pay and Click to Pay enab=
led, and Apple Pay domain registration for our venues' menu domains
3. Card payments and refunds through the REST API (payments, refunds, voids),=
 and Pay by Link
4. Confirmation of the go-live / certification steps for a partner taking pay=
ments for many hospitality venues (sub-merchants)
5. Whether Barclaycard can offer an in-person card terminal API (cloud or loc=
al) for EPOS tills

OUR CALL TODAY
Vesopa x Barclaycard Partner LIVE API meeting for Smartpay Fuse
Wednesday 21 October 2026, 11:00 to 11:30 UK time (BST)
Google Meet: https://meet.google.com/qum-eoec-wnf
Or dial +44 20 3957 2080, PIN 471279590
More phone numbers: https://tel.meet/qum-eoec-wnf?pin=3D6261463474265

The calendar invite is attached: Accept, Decline or Maybe from your inbox. If=
 11:00 does not suit, reply with a better time, or call me on +44 7848 494341.

Thank you, and we look forward to speaking with you.

Kind regards,
Muzahid Islam
Vesopa Developer, Vesopa Software Ltd
muzahid@vesopa.com | +44 7848 494341

On behalf of Meirion Davies, Director
Vesopa Software Ltd and Vesopa Ltd
info@vesopasoftware.com | info@vesopa.com

